er</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Leboeuf-Yde</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Sorensen</surname><given-names>JS</given-names></name><name><surname>Bendix</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>An epidemiologic study of MRI and low back pain in 13-year-old children</article-title><source>Spine</source><year>2005</year><volume>30</volume><fpage>798</fpage><lpage>806</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15803084</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/01.brs.0000157424.72598.ec</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Harvey</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Tanner</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Low back pain in young athletes. A practical approach</article-title><source>Sports Med</source><year>1991</year><volume>12</volume><fpage>394</fpage><lpage>406</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1838423</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Feldman</surname><given-names>DE</given-names></name><name><surname>Shrier</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Rossignol</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Abenhaim</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Risk factors for the development of low back pain in adolescence</article-title><source>Am J Epidemiol</source><year>2001</year><volume>154</volume><fpage>30</fpage><lpage>6</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11427402</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/aje/154.1.30</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sherry</surname><given-names>DD</given-names></name><name><surname>McGuire</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Me